msgid "=== \"Atlas 200I Pro\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 200I Pro\""

msgid "#### Pull the image"
msgstr "#### 拉取镜像"

msgid "#### Start the container"
msgstr "#### 启动容器"

msgid "???+ warning \"Atlas 200I Pro container startup requirements\""
msgstr "???+ warning \"Atlas 200I Pro 容器启动要求\""

msgid "=== \"Ubuntu\""
msgstr "=== \"Ubuntu\""

msgid "=== \"openEuler\""
msgstr "=== \"openEuler\""

msgid ""
"Atlas 200I Pro selects its NPU with `ASCEND_VISIBLE_DEVICES`, so the "
"container needs Ascend Docker Runtime on the host. The runtime mounts the "
"driver libraries, but its default mount list looks for `npu-smi` at "
"`/usr/local/bin/npu-smi`, while this product installs it at "
"`/usr/local/sbin/npu-smi`, so the command below mounts it explicitly. The "
"command also passes the `ascend_manager` and `user_config` devices and the "
"Atlas 300I Duo host libraries. Make sure every host path it mounts exists."
msgstr ""
"Atlas 200I Pro 通过 `ASCEND_VISIBLE_DEVICES` 选择其 NPU，因此容器需要在宿主机上安装 Ascend "
"Docker Runtime。该运行时负责挂载驱动库，但其默认挂载列表会在 `/usr/local/bin/npu-smi` 查找 `npu-"
"smi`，而本产品将 `npu-smi` 安装到 `/usr/local/sbin/npu-smi`，因此下面的命令会显式挂载它。该命令还会传入 "
"`ascend_manager` 和 `user_config` 设备以及 Atlas 300I Duo 宿主机库。请确保其挂载的每个宿主机路径都存在。"
